a&_nc_ohc=WVu9P52SLgEQ7kNvwEVFqi5&_nc_oc=AdmPpwT_37N7MsMitdiX1r3scOnwxVqN3OaAhksYxwk1P-BeojVG8Yi-4uksL58jazI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftqjZBwacGCeYMnNOzVkvrg1s30JHbVziZGSo5DR4PBTQ&oe=69A1851C"}, {"file_name": "MECHA_Screenshot_4.png", "id": "1337227934301215", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619432_1337227937634548_1948501587571807527_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xo4wd1BE2FYQ7kNvwEvk-AC&_nc_oc=Adl225nt2-rCVBM6ObuljHvF7ebJDqjctPeDzNVAsrU50VLKxqG517HcVmpZY2rPn-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft4cszU_iUjlot83T_a_C8UOQsehhMh47SpHdQz5R3MTQ&oe=69A17F64"}, {"file_name": "MECHA_Screenshot_5.png", "id": "2374131403025348", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619715_2374131406358681_5109830869351100948_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tl-QiknOZREQ7kNvwHxp-gu&_nc_oc=AdnwTPmIgESNkszZwOSSIl-6UTzlYD9OaXRHOPVPHz1DdQ8GheZCmmX36sDlbtVNP6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfurQUMiEEAviTJNxR6J7wgxTWWXoG16vM3cUoW98l45og&oe=69A1A0C5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "MECHA_CoverArt_2560_1440.png", "id": "1155209546729805", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619646_1155209550063138_8510117434990572236_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qur2C2_YaiAQ7kNvwFmrM-R&_nc_oc=AdlGFaoOqCSP2ULm4jfNkD4S_lzoUwLwN_NkrZZ1uYwQSEmptv-wjpInfSzVCGG8jbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afthqp3DMzqDYE_6W7AXFBR4zAoiDICIItl8IkYUrW3rWw&oe=69A1798F"}, "display_name": "MECHA", "keywords": ["mech", "robot", "shooter", "scifi", "action"], "long_description": "You didn\u2019t just buy a headset. You bought the keys to a **200-TON FLYING MECH**. \n\nFight for glory in the Mecha League - the ultimate VR combat sport. Built for the Meta Quest, **MECHA** delivers **EXPLOSIVE ARENA BATTLES** with **HIGH-SPEED AERIAL COMBAT**, and a full career mode with sponsors, tournaments, upgrades, and rival pilots.\n\nRise through the ranks, customize your mecha, and carve your name into the league with every thunderous win.  \n\n# BECOME THE ULTIMATE PILOT\n\nMaster the **lean movement** system, using your body to strafe, dash, and weave through fire. Combat demands both **precision aim** and **smart defense**: line up your shots, then raise your arm to deploy a shield that blocks incoming fire. \n\nWhen the moment strikes, trigger the **Gigaform** to triple your size and dominate the arena as a towering titan. \n\n# DOMINATE THE LEAGUE\n\nClimb the ladder from Rookie to All-Star by winning **tournaments**. Enemies you dominate evolve into **top rivals** with massive cash bounties on their heads. Impress corporate sponsors by **completing high-stakes missions** that can yield massive payouts. \n\n# YOUR MECH, YOUR RULES \n\n- **6 Game Modes:** Dominate in Deathmatch, outlast the competition in Survival, hunt the giant in Juggernaut, or squad up and take the win in team modes. \n- **Visual Customization:** Personalize your mech with custom paint schemes and adjustable neon emissive glows. \n- **Mod System:** Fine-tune your loadout with an upgrade system where every mod offers strategic trade-offs.", "short_description": "You didn\u2019t just buy a headset. You bought the keys to a 200-TON FLYING MECH. \n\nFight for glory in the Mecha League - the ultimate VR combat sport. Built for the Meta Quest, MECHA delivers EXPLOSIVE ARENA BATTLES with HIGH-SPEED AERIAL COMBAT, and a full career mode with sponsors, tournaments, upgrades, and rival pilots.  \n\nRise through the ranks, customize your mecha, and carve your name into the league with every thunderous win."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.playmechavr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hyperlight VR LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://playmechavr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_ratin